# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
.venv-*/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Env / secrets
.env
*.tfvars

# Terraform
.terraform/
# `data.archive_file` writes the Lambda zip here at PLAN time, so any local
# `terraform plan` would otherwise leave an untracked build artifact in
# `git status`. `build/` above does not match a dot-prefixed directory.
infra/Terraform/modules/*/.build/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.lock.hcl

# Pipeline run artifacts (logs + paused state)
#
# ANCHORED WITH A LEADING SLASH, and that is a measured fix rather than tidying. A bare
# `runs/` matches a directory AT ANY DEPTH, so it also swallowed `web/app/api/runs/` and
# `web/app/(routes)/runs/` -- the two lanes building the run screens each hit it
# independently, and in both cases `git add` REPORTED SUCCESS while staging nothing:
#
#     $ git check-ignore -v web/app/api/runs/route.ts
#     .gitignore:27:runs/    web/app/api/runs/route.ts
#
# A pattern written for one directory silently claimed every directory of that name in a
# growing repository, and the failure mode is the worst available: no error, no output,
# and a commit that looks complete. Both lanes worked around it with a scoped negation in
# `web/.gitignore`; those stay as belt and braces, but the rule itself is now correct.
#
# `/runs/` is the pipeline's own run directory. A linked worktree's `runs/` sits at that
# worktree's root, and `.claude/` is ignored wholesale below, so nothing that needed
# ignoring stops being ignored.
/runs/
/runs-archive-*/
build/
dist/

.claude/
.superpowers/
# The team's personal photographs. The SQUARE crops under docs/pitch/photos/square/ are
# committed because the deck embeds them and it must build on anyone's machine; the
# originals are not ours to redistribute and are large.
docs/pitch/photos/*.jpeg
docs/pitch/photos/*.png
docs/pitch/photos/*.jpg
!docs/pitch/photos/square/

# PowerPoint's lock file, created while a deck is open in the app. Committed once by
# accident; it is a transient artifact of an editor, not a deliverable.
~$*.pptx

# macOS Finder metadata. Committed once by accident via `git add -A`.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
